   "heading": {
    "en": "Area declared as Changi Airport"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2. The lands and waters in Singapore described in the Schedule, including all roads, buildings, installations, and equipment therein, are hereby declared to be an airport, known as Changi Airport, for the purposes of the Act."
